Backport of realm/realm-core#8100 (commit 3db4b8f6e3dc6a4f8de3176bb5170997eb257728,
author yarin-mag <yarinmagdaci@gmail.com>): fix out-of-bounds access to the Mixed
`keys` array in ArrayMixed::insert/erase/move. Drop this patch once the vendored
realm-core includes the upstream fix.

